sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor A as Admin
    participant V as Vue 3 + Inertia<br/>Admin/Pengembalian.vue
    participant R as ProsesPengembalianRequest<br/>(Gate kelola-transaksi)
    participant C as PeminjamanController
    participant S as LayananPeminjaman
    participant O as Eloquent<br/>Loan, BookCopy, BookReturn
    participant DB as MySQL 8.4
    A->>V: Pilih peminjaman Aktif → Proses Pengembalian → konfirmasi
    V->>C: POST /admin/pengembalian (idPeminjaman)
    C->>R: authorize() + rules()
    C->>S: kembalikan(kodePeminjaman, admin)
    rect rgb(235, 242, 255)
        Note over S,DB: DB::transaction — urutan kunci members → book_copies → loans
        S->>DB: SELECT … FOR UPDATE (members, book_copies, loans)
        alt Loan bukan Aktif / sudah ada returns
            S-->>V: galat validasi — "sudah dikembalikan"
        else Eksemplar bukan Dipinjam
            S-->>V: galat validasi — periksa konsistensi data
        end
        S->>O: BookReturn::save() returned_at, staff_id
        O->>DB: INSERT returns (UNIQUE loan_id cegah pengembalian ganda)
        S->>O: Loan → Selesai, BookCopy → Tersedia
        O->>DB: UPDATE loans, UPDATE book_copies
        S->>DB: INSERT audit_logs pengembalian.dibuat
        S->>DB: COMMIT
    end
    Note over S: Status anggota tidak diperiksa — anggota Nonaktif tetap dapat mengembalikan buku
    C-->>V: 302 /admin/pengembalian + flash kode KB-…
